sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin
  participant GW as API Gateway
  participant TS as Ticket Service
  participant DS as Department Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  Admin->>GW: POST /tickets/{id}/assign with Bearer JWT
  Note over GW: Validate JWT expiry and ADMIN role. Invalid token returns 401. Missing role returns 403. Stop request.
  GW->>TS: gRPC AssignTicket with x-request-id and 5 s deadline
  TS->>PG: Load ticket and require status SUBMITTED
  PG-->>TS: Ticket data
  TS->>DS: GET /departments/{id} over REST with 3 s timeout
  alt Department exists
    DS-->>TS: 200 Department found
    TS->>PG: Commit ASSIGNED status with history and outbox in one transaction
    PG-->>TS: COMMIT OK
    TS-->>GW: Ticket ASSIGNED
    GW-->>Admin: HTTP 200 with X-Request-Id
  else Department lookup fails
    DS-->>TS: 404 missing or 503 unavailable or 504 timeout
    TS-->>GW: Reject assignment. No transition committed.
    GW-->>Admin: HTTP error 404 / 503 / 504
  end
